# nexora-action-code: get_version
# Huawei YunShan OS has a different banner/version line from VRP V5/V8.
Value Filldown,Required OS_NAME (YunShan\s*OS)
Value Required VERSION ([0-9][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*)
Value PRODUCT_VERSION ([^)]+)
Value Required MODEL ([A-Za-z0-9_.-]+)
Value UPTIME (.+)
Value PATCH_VERSION (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*(?:Huawei|HUAWEI)\s+Versatile\s+Routing\s+Platform\s+Software\s*$$
  ^\s*(?:Huawei|HUAWEI)\s+${OS_NAME}\s*$$
  ^\s*(?:Huawei\s+)?${OS_NAME},?\s+Version\s+${VERSION}\s+\(${PRODUCT_VERSION}\)\s*$$
  ^\s*Version\s+${VERSION}\s+\(${PRODUCT_VERSION}\)\s*$$
  ^\s*Copyright.*$$
  ^\s*(?:Huawei|HUAWEI)\s+${MODEL}\s+(?:Router\s+)?uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}\s*$$ -> Chassis
  ^\s*\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}\s+.*$$
  ^\s*<[^>]+>.*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error

Chassis
  ^\s*Patch\s+[Vv]ersion\s*:\s*${PATCH_VERSION}\s*$$
  ^\s*MPU.*$$ -> Hardware
  ^\s*$$
  ^\s*<[^>]+>.*$$
  ^. -> Error

Hardware
  ^\s*Patch\s+[Vv]ersion\s*:\s*${PATCH_VERSION}\s*$$
  ^.*$$
